FigTreeKit-MCP is an MCP (Model Context Protocol) server that exposes the
FigTreeKit phylogenetic-tree workflow (validate, analyze, style, export,
render) to AI assistants. It delegates all tree computation and rendering to
the FigTreeKit kernel; this repository does not vendor or modify the FigTree
Java sources.

